// Actor / Critic: 3x [Linear → LayerNorm → ELU] then linear head;
//   orthogonal init √2 hidden; head gain 0.01 (actor) / 1.0 (critic).
// PPO update (per minibatch):
// 1. compute ratio = exp(logπ - logπ_old)
// 2. adaptive KL: lr ×/÷ 1.5 if KL ≷ 1.5·desired_kl  (tighter than 2.0)
// 3. per-minibatch advantage renormalization (mean/std of THIS batch)
// 4. surrogate = max(ratio·-A, clip(ratio, 1±ε)·-A).mean()
// 5. value loss: clipped Huber (δ = 10) on (V − R) and (V_clipped − R), max
// 6. action smoothness: + α·μ². α = 3e-4
// 7. loss = surrogate + c_v · value_loss − c_e · entropy + α · ‖μ‖²
// 8. Adam(lr, eps=1e-5), clip grad-norm to max_grad_norm

// Actor / Critic: Linear → LN → activation → 2x ResidualBlock → Linear;
//   orthogonal init gain 1, head 0.01
// Forward: in train mode, add 0.02·N(0,I) Gaussian noise to obs and critic_obs
// Rollout: include prev_actions in mini_batch_generator
// PPO update:
// 1. KL adaptive lr: ×/÷ 1.5 at KL > 1.5·desired_kl / < desired_kl/1.5
// 2. surrogate clipped
// 3. value: clipped smooth_L1(V, R)
// 4. + 2e-4·‖μ‖² + 1e-3·‖μ - μ_prev‖²   (action-rate penalty using prev action from rollout)
// 5. Adam(lr=1e-4, weight_decay=1e-5)
// 6. clip grad norm; entropy_coef = 0.01; epochs = 4; mini_batches = 4

// Actor / Critic: build_backbone Linear → LN → SiLU; orthogonal √2; head gain 0.01 actor / 1.0 critic
// update_distribution: μ = mean_scale·tanh(MLP(obs));  σ = clamp(self.std, 0.05, 1.5)
// act: clamp(rsample(N(μ, σ)), -1, 1)   ;   evaluate clamps actions and recomputes log-prob
// Storage:
//   r̃ = tanh(reward · 0.1) / 0.1   (reward squashing)
//   GAE with λ_mix = λ·(0.95 + 0.05·(1 - done))   (slightly more truncation at terminal)
//   advantage clamp to [-4, 4] then per-rollout standardize
// PPO update:
// 1. ratio = exp(logπ - logπ_old)
// 2. surrogate = max(
//      -A·ratio, -A·clip(ratio, 1±ε), -A·(1 + clip(ratio-1, ±sym_clip))
//   ).mean()
// 3. value loss: clipped smooth_L1 with β = critic_huber_delta
// 4. behavior_loss = ‖μ - μ_old‖² · 1[ratio < 1+ε]
// 5. loss = surrogate + c_v·value + kl_coef·KL + behavior_coef·behavior - c_e·entropy/(1 + 0.5·KL)
// 6. clip grad-norm; adaptive-KL adjusts lr by 1.5

// Actor: Linear[obs→512] → LN → ELU → ... → [128→a]; head gain 0.01
// Critic: Linear[critic_obs→768] → LN → ELU → ... → [128→1]; head gain 1.0
// PPO update:
// 1. adaptive KL lr: ×/÷ 1.5 at KL > 2·desired_kl / < desired_kl/2 (default thresholds)
// 2. if norm_advantages_per_dim:  Â = (A - μ_d)/σ_d  per dim;  else flatten standardize
// 3. surrogate = clipped (standard PPO)
// 4. value loss = clipped Huber (δ) on (V - R) and (V_clipped - R)
// 5. loss = surrogate + c_v·value - c_e·entropy

// Actor / Critic: Linear → LN → ELU stacks at widths [512,256,128] / [768,256,128]; head 0.01 gain
// On done: noise_scale ← 0.9995·noise_scale  (per-episode decay)
// Rollout buffer: store TD-errors |δ_t| as priorities = sqrt(|δ| + 1e-6)
//   compute_returns: GAE; advantages standardized then clamped to [-10, 10]
